              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eky'aha muheru, B'eishe-emwe, mushemererwe omuri Mukama. Okugaruka kubahandiikira ebyo, ahabwangye tikirikundusya, kandi ahabwanyu nikibareetera obusingye.",
          "type": "text",
